TI  - Securing blockchain-based crowdfunding platforms: an integrated graph neural networks and machine learning approach
T2  - ELECTRONIC COMMERCE RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Blockchain
KW  - Crowdfunding
KW  - Cybersecurity
KW  - Smart contract
KW  - Anomaly detection
