TI  - Next-generation cyber attack prediction for IoT systems: leveraging multi-class SVM and optimized CHAID decision tree
T2  - JOURNAL OF CLOUD COMPUTING-ADVANCES SYSTEMS AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Anomaly detection
KW  - CHAID decision tree
KW  - IoT cyber attacks
KW  - Multistep attack
KW  - Security investigation
KW  - Zero-day attack
KW  - INTERNET
