TI  - SANTA: Semi-supervised Adversarial Network Threat and Anomaly Detection System
T2  - ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE XL, AI 2023
LA  - English
CP  - 43rd SGAI International Conference on Innovative Techniques and Applications of Artificial Intelligence (AI)
