TI  - An efficient network intrusion detection approach based on logistic regression model and parallel artificial bee colony algorithm
T2  - COMPUTER STANDARDS & INTERFACES
LA  - English
KW  - Network intrusion detection system
KW  - Anomaly detection
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - Artificial bee colony
