TI  - Enhancing Cyber Threat Identification in Open-Source Intelligence Feeds Through an Improved Semi-Supervised Generative Adversarial Learning Approach With Contrastive Learning
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
LA  - English
KW  - Generative adversarial networks
KW  - BERT
