TI  - DESC-IDS: Towards an efficient real-time automotive intrusion detection system based on deep evolving stream clustering
T2  - FUTURE GENERATION COMPUTER SYSTEMS-THE INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ESCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - In -vehicle network
KW  - Control area network
KW  - Anomaly detection
