TI  - FedChain-Hunter: A reliable and privacy-preserving aggregation for federated threat hunting framework in SDN-based IIoT
T2  - INTERNET OF THINGS
LA  - English
KW  - Software defined networking
KW  - SDN
KW  - Federated learning
KW  - Blockchain
KW  - Data privacy
KW  - Secure aggregation
KW  - Threat hunting
KW  - Industrial internet of things
