TI  - Deep SARSA-based reinforcement learning approach for anomaly network intrusion detection system
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF INFORMATION SECURITY
LA  - English
KW  - NIDS
KW  - Anomaly detection
KW  - Deep reinforcement learning
