TI  - Damage Detection and Safety Diagnosis for Immovable Cultural Assets Using Deep Learning Framework
T2  - 2023 25TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON ADVANCED COMMUNICATION TECHNOLOGY, ICACT
LA  - English
CP  - 25th International Conference on Advanced Communication Technology (ICACT) - New Cyber Security Risks for Enterprise Amidst COVID-19 Pandemic
